  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to walk this",
      "items": [
        "Left to right is roughly bottom to top: memory, engine, network, game",
        "Nothing here is a prerequisite for anything else — the arrows are roads, not gates",
        "If you already think in cache lines, the chunk is the fastest way in",
        "If you want the surprise first, go straight to the two clock domains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The three facts the whole territory rests on",
      "items": [
        "Data lives in fixed-size chunks and is read by stride, never by pointer",
        "The client sends intent and the server sends truth, and nothing else crosses",
        "Nobody on either screen is looking at the present, and that is deliberate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Two regions with no maps yet",
      "items": [
        "II · world, systems, update loop — bootstrap, system groups, baking, blobs",
        "V · the BovineLabs stack — Grove as a bytecode virtual machine, Canopy, Nerve",
        "Both have chapters. Neither has been drawn.",
        "The atlas lists forty. That gap is the honest state of the work."
      ]
    }
